THIRD-PARTY ATTRIBUTION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This work builds on the following open-source projects:

* Hugging Face Open-R1 — https://github.com/huggingface/open-r1
  Apache License 2.0.
  The training entry points, recipe/config layout, and GRPO training loop in
  `open_r1_imp/` are derived from Open-R1.

* TRL (Transformer Reinforcement Learning) — https://github.com/huggingface/trl
  Apache License 2.0.
  `MultiRewardTrainer`, `IntuitorTrainer` and `GRPOGTTrainer` subclass and
  override `trl.GRPOTrainer`.

* INTUITOR — https://github.com/sunblaze-ucb/Intuitor
  The self-certainty reward implementation is ported from INTUITOR's
  `INTUITORTrainer`. See `train_4090_imp/rewards/self_certainty.py`.

* EMPO — https://github.com/QingyangZhang/EMPO
  The cluster-voting / semantic-consensus reward follows the approach of EMPO.

Benchmarks and evaluation harnesses (GSM8K, MATH-500, MMLU-Pro, AIME,
LiveCodeBench, CRUXEval, lighteval, ZeroEval) are the property of their
respective authors and are used under their own licenses.
